##

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.498 line:85%
<c.yellow>Hi, I'm Beardyman.</c>

00:00:02.785 --> 00:00:05.183 line:91%
<c.yellow>Where were you with the
"and I'm Tom Scott"? Jesus.</c>

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:08.328 line:91%
