<c.yellow>This chemistry, honestly(!)</c>

00:00:09.899 --> 00:00:12.539 line:85%
I'm with Beardyman, who...

00:00:12.539 --> 00:00:16.086 position:73% line:91%
Are you just staring stone in the camera there?
<c.yellow>I'm staring dead-eye into that camera.</c>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.265 align:start size:88% position:13% line:43%
<c.green>[indistinct]</c>

00:00:17.265 --> 00:00:19.693 line:91%
