00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:32.955 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:05:32.955 --> 00:05:35.472 line:91%
<c.yellow>I've already DM'd her on Twitter.
It's happening. Right, listen.</c>

00:05:35.472 --> 00:05:37.463 line:85%
I don't— I don't have words!

00:05:37.463 --> 00:05:40.978 position:61% line:91%
I love it when I just get to stand back
and watch someone do... just...

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.586 line:91%
I don't have words, okay?!
That's amazing!

00:05:44.586 --> 00:05:47.114 line:91%
<c.yellow>Where we're going...</c>
<c.yellow><00:05:45.795><c>we don't need words.</c></c>

00:05:47.114 --> 00:05:49.684 line:91%
