00:06:01.067 --> 00:06:03.982 line:91%
<c.yellow>with as little...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Aspiration.</c>

00:06:03.982 --> 00:06:05.439 position:61% line:85%
<c.yellow>As little aspiration as possible, yeah.</c>

00:06:05.439 --> 00:06:06.765 line:91%
/pəʔ/
<c.yellow>Mhm.</c>

00:06:06.765 --> 00:06:09.239 line:91%
