00:07:26.159 --> 00:07:28.618 line:91%
<c.yellow>which is sweeping a
resonant filter.</c>

00:07:28.618 --> 00:07:30.642 line:85%
<c.yellow>That's what that's doing.</c>

00:07:32.543 --> 00:07:34.792 position:77% line:91%
<c.cyan><i>(beat stops)</i></c>
